---
title: Telemetry receipt · acknowledged only after a durable commit
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant browser as Browser SDK
  participant server as Server SDK
  participant edge as Ingestion edge
  participant journal as Durable ingress journal
  participant jobs as Durable Jobs

  par Browser edge
    browser->>edge: WebSocket batch · original IDs
  and Server edge
    server->>edge: OTLP/HTTP request · original IDs
  end
  Note over edge: In memory, before any write:<br/>bounded decompression, authentication,<br/>outer-envelope validation,<br/>non-overridable never-collect checks
  alt Forbidden material
    edge-->>browser: close 1008 · unsafe_data_detected
    edge-->>server: refuse the request · unsafe_data_detected
    Note over edge: Keeps only a safe typed failure record.
  else Permanent schema or payload-limit violation
    edge-->>browser: exact non-retryable failure
    edge-->>server: exact non-retryable failure
  else Transient quota or capacity limit
    edge-->>browser: flow control · acknowledgement held
    edge-->>server: retryable OTLP status + Retry-After
  else Journal unavailable
    Note over edge,journal: No acknowledgement. Producers retry under<br/>their source contract, with their original IDs.
  else Accepted
    edge->>journal: one transaction · receipt + normalized records + indexes
    journal-->>edge: committed
    edge-->>browser: ack · highest contiguous export_sequence
    edge-->>server: OTLP full success
    journal-)jobs: correlation + readiness evaluation
  end
